WEBVTT

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:41.030
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:47.410
<i>Taichi and the Chosen Ones with their
partner Digimon continue their journey</i>

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:54.880
<i>to prevent the revival of the bringer
of destruction and darkness, Millenniumon.</i>

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:58.970
<i>Amid the tough battles held
on the Eternal Continent,</i>

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:03.180
<i>Yamato and Gabumon showed signs
of a new power.</i>

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:08.350
<i>And now, that true form is about
to be revealed.</i>

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:31.420
MACHMON

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:40.260
What is this place?

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.930
It's so big!

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.060
But it's rundown.

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:46.180
I wonder if there's any food.

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:49.440
Gabumon?

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.190
Oh, look there!

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:55.230
Something's moving really fast.

00:02:57.690 --> 00:02:58.690
Machmon...

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:02.360
It looks like this place
is a racing circuit.

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:11.790
Yamato...

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.960
I wanna run!

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.340
Gabumon Evolution!

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:22.970
Garurumon!

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:30.600
ACTIVATE, METALGARURUMON

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:44.240
What do you want?

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:46.990
Wanna have a match with us?

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.000
You, what's your name?

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.460
Garurumon!

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.260
You like to run?

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:58.840
Yeah! It feels awesome to run with Yamato!

00:03:58.840 --> 00:03:59.890
Yamato?

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:01.800
You mean him.

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:03.720
He's my partner!

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:08.430
If Yamato's with me,
I can run faster than I can imagine!

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:15.770
Machmon... after watching you,
I was itching to run and I couldn't wait!

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:19.270
Please! Race us!

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:21.650
I wouldn't do it.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:27.410
There wasn't a soul that didn't regret
saying that to me.

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:32.160
Let's see about that.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.670
This place is pretty nice.

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:40.340
We can see the race track perfectly.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.640
Could this place be...

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:44.930
Looks like they started!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:49.430
This racing circuit
is approximately 2,500 meters long

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.020
with three large banked turns.

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:56.150
Koshiro-san, what's a banked turn?

00:04:56.150 --> 00:05:01.110
It's the turns where the track is sloped
so that the outer side is taller.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:05.700
This way, they can turn with momentum
without having to slow down.

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:09.160
There's an even more difficult
banked turn before the goal.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:13.290
This 450-degree looped curve
is this course's most hardest part.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:16.210
Wow... how extreme!

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.850
Good, we're above!

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:32.260
We'll take the lead this way!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.310
I'll crush you!

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:41.690
Machmon?!

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:47.240
What is it?!

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:49.290
<i>Machmon is attacking Garurumon!</i>

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:50.160
What?!

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.960
But this is a race!

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:55.750
I knew it! This is the Digital World
Grand Prix Circuit!

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.210
You know it?

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.760
<i>The Digital World Grand Prix...</i>

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:04.890
<i>Its origin is not clear, but it's an old
festival where speedy Digimon gather</i>

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:08.220
<i>and compete for the title
of the fastest Digimon.</i>

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.970
But the truth is...

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:16.100
It's a death race where
any action is allowed while racing!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.820
Machmon, what's going on?!

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:21.110
Is this how you race?!

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:29.780
Wait!

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:33.450
Machmon! What in the world is going on?!

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:42.580
Stop...

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.880
Enough... already!

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:52.760
Machmon flew!

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:58.020
Oh no!

00:06:58.430 --> 00:06:59.890
-Yamato!
-Yeah!

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:01.900
Garurumon!

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.280
Garurumon...

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.080
You okay?!

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.170
Hang on!

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:21.620
Gabumon!

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:23.920
What about Machmon?

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:26.300
Hang in there, Gabumon!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:27.760
Gabumon!

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:35.390
Gabumon.

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:37.650
Are you okay?!

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:38.690
Yeah.

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:41.900
Thank goodness! Do your wounds hurt?

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:44.770
Thanks. I seem okay.

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:47.450
I apologize.

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:48.820
Y-Yeah...

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:50.740
Machmon carried you here.

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:54.200
Since it was my fault.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.370
But why--

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:56.700
Wow, cool!

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.790
They're the grand prix trophy plaques.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:01.620
They're all Machmon's.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.340
That's amazing!

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:06.670
That's all in the past.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:12.180
I've been racing alone
for a long time now.

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:13.180
What?

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:16.430
Did the races come to an end?

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.930
As you can see.

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.230
That's very unfortunate,

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:28.950
but I don't approve of attacking someone
who doesn't even know of the death race.

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:32.490
When I get into it,
my old habits come back.

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:35.200
I can't help it myself.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:40.460
But with your speed, Machmon,
you don't need to get in others' ways!

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:42.450
It's a different story in a match.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:46.210
You can't protect
the champion's title by staying fair.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:49.840
You don't need to care about that now!

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:54.220
You're still racing by yourself,
because you just like to race, right?

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:57.180
As long as it's a race, I have to win.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:59.970
If I give up on that,
it'll be like giving up on myself.

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:05.390
I heard the cries of your soul
in your racing.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:09.110
Race me one more time!

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:10.910
Gabumon...

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:14.650
I want to race you at your best
completely on speed!

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:17.660
I believe in you.

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.080
Since you can run that fast.

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.370
You...

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:26.800
When I run with Yamato on my back,
I really enjoy it!

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:29.170
It feels like I'm one with him.

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:31.130
That's why I can run fast.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.010
You might not have a partner,

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:37.380
but you have a friend
that you can compete and race with.

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:43.430
If we race each other,
I'm sure we can have the best race ever!

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:46.690
All right.

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:49.900
But no battling!

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:51.070
Understand?

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:52.320
Yeah!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:55.740
If that's the case,
we'll support you guys too.

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:58.330
Gabumon and Machmon, do your best!

00:09:58.330 --> 00:09:59.570
Yeah!

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:09.090
Is something wrong, Yamato-san?

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:11.790
Are you worried about Machmon?

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:16.180
<i>That sudden shift in Machmon
during the race.</i>

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:19.970
<i>Machmon supposedly lost control...</i>

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:24.220
But there's more to it... Something else.

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:27.980
If we race, we might find that answer.

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:33.270
The key to the match
is probably this 450 loop.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:44.450
<i>Here it is! The match of the century!</i>

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:49.090
Joe Kido as your announcer here!
And your commentator is Koshiro Izumi!

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:50.340
Now please!

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:55.090
"We'll have to see how the newcomer
Garurumon takes on the veteran champion,"

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:56.470
is what he'd say.

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:58.600
Hey, where's Izumi-kun?

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:03.140
Fight! Go, go, Garurumon!

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:08.900
Fight! Go, go, Garurumon!

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:11.610
Do I have to do this too?

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:13.990
The rules are very simple.

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:18.650
The first one to goal after finishing
three laps of the course wins.

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:23.700
Who will be the victor,
Garurumon or Machmon?!

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.870
Let me thank you while I can.

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:31.000
I never thought I'd be able
to race someone again.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:34.000
I want to make this a good, last race.

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:35.710
Last?

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:38.760
Don't get near me while I'm running.

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:42.850
Because if I get into it again,
it'll ruin the race.

00:11:42.850 --> 00:11:44.220
Alright, then!

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.760
Starting in ten seconds!

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:48.850
Nine, eight.

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:50.860
Seven, six.

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:52.860
Five, four.

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:55.860
Three, two, one...

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:57.860
Start!

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:01.870
And the race has started!

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:03.990
-Go!
-Do your best!

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:09.870
So fast!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.420
Machmon takes the lead
in the first corner!

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:16.040
They're neck and neck already!

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:19.340
Now, how will the situation unfold
from here?!

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:20.430
Tentomon-san!

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:21.430
Huh?

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:24.060
Tentomon was called by Koshiro and left.

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:25.800
Say what?

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.730
Will you leave the plan to me?

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:36.690
Yeah.

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:39.530
I'll just trust you and run, Yamato.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:45.330
<i>First, we'll stay quiet for the first lap
and see how Machmon moves.</i>

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:46.410
<i>Roger!</i>

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:57.040
These turns are hard...

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:05.800
There aren't any noticeable changes yet.

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:14.560
-So fast!
-So windy!

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:17.520
They've both entered the second lap!

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.020
They're close...

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:22.320
It's time we go.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:24.070
Roger.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:29.580
I knew it.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.710
<i>Watch out!</i>

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:40.960
Again!

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:43.260
Hey, that's against the rules!

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.720
I thought Machmon wasn't going to attack!

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.180
Dodge it...

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.100
Dodge it, please!

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:53.900
Machmon...

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:54.980
<i>Yamato-san!</i>

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:58.060
<i>Machmon might not be
meaning to attack you!</i>

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:02.730
<i>I've detected a different vital sign
within Machmon's body!</i>

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:04.110
What is it?

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:07.620
<i>A Digimon that leeches off
other Digimon, Parasimon!</i>

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:08.700
I see!

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:12.370
The Digimon who become the hosts
of Parasimon

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:17.160
can maximize their own power
in exchange for their energy.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:19.880
But that's not all.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:24.260
Their body and mind
become infested by Parasimon

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:27.760
and soon they're taken over completely!

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:30.140
<i>Where is this Parasimon?!</i>

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.760
I'm not sure.

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:35.150
<i>They could be completely fused together...</i>

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:38.390
No, Machmon is struggling.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.860
Machmon shouldn't be completely
taken over yet.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.110
<i>All right.</i>

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:46.070
<i>Then I'll try to find Parasimon somehow.</i>

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.330
Machmon!

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.250
You're being taken over?!

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:02.880
Yes, I wished for it myself!

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:05.550
That can't be! Why?!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:11.050
Why, Machmon?!

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:16.930
So I don't lose the champion's title
and to gain my maximum speed.

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:20.150
<i>That's why I let Parasimon in.</i>

00:15:20.150 --> 00:15:23.490
<i>We're the exact opposite of you two,
the worst mix.</i>

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:25.940
<i>Just a fake champion!</i>

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:27.950
No way!

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:29.330
Run!

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:32.830
I can't stop this body from attacking you!

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:36.200
No! This is a race between you and me!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:41.710
Once the host perishes, this thing
will find a new host to take over.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.580
But I won't let that happen.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:47.710
I'm gonna continue running like this
and blow up with Parasimon!

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:50.590
You planned this from the start!

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.970
I played the fake champion

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:56.310
<i>and lost my friends.</i>

00:15:56.310 --> 00:16:00.100
<i>The only thing that remained
was this unbearable solitude.</i>

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:03.770
I've had enough.

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.610
I'm gonna crush you!

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:10.360
We have no choice but to fight!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:13.860
All right!

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:20.660
Garurumon Super Evolution!

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:32.300
Weregarurumon!

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:49.270
<i>Yamato-san!</i>

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:52.030
When the broken legs were recovered,

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:55.120
the energy was focused
in the engine's core.

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:57.530
Parasimon is probably there!

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:59.280
Weregarurumon!

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:01.080
Yeah!

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.430
Yamato!

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:24.860
Stop, Parasimon!
These guys have nothing to do with me!

00:17:24.860 --> 00:17:26.060
No!

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:30.070
We do have something to do with you!

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:33.450
What are you saying? Hurry and run!

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:39.200
It's fine! Just let me go!

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:41.040
No!

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:43.250
My partner told you already!

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.210
We've raced together...

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:46.960
We're friends!

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.420
Machmon!

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:53.210
I won't ever let you go!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:18:00.350
Me and Yamato
are going to put an end to your struggles!

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:13.780
Yeah... that's right.

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:17.870
Even if you're tormented
by your mistakes or solitude,

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:19.320
don't give up!

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:23.790
You must overcome your past, your present,

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:25.790
and move forward!

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:31.670
Live, Machmon!

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:47.520
Weregarurumon Mega Evolution!

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:06.910
Metalgarurumon!

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.040
METALGARURUMON

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:11.420
-S-Say... what?!
-What?!

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:14.170
Is that... a Mega Digimon?!

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:16.800
Metalgarurumon!

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:38.360
PARASIMON

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:42.110
Cocytus Breath!

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.630
Machmon, you're okay now!

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:58.260
Machmon, slow down!

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:00.130
Machmon!

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:05.390
Machmon's gonna spin out
of the 450 loop at this rate!

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:07.770
And it's a cliff up ahead!

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:09.770
Metalgarurumon!

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:12.270
Yeah, leave it to me!

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:14.610
Garuru Tomahawk!

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:26.410
<i>This is how it should be.</i>

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:30.460
<i>Now, my race will finally
come to an end...</i>

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:31.830
Not yet!

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:55.570
Now, you should be all good.

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:59.360
You'll be able to run freely now, Machmon.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:03.780
Let's go. The goal is still ahead.

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:07.490
You two...

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.140
<i>The border has now begun to blend</i>

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.140
<i>ima mazari atteku border</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>"It's uncharted territory from here!"</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>koko kara wa jinrui mitou desu!</i>

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.610
<i>All that you desire awaits you</i>

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.610
<i>nozomu kagiri no subete ga aru kara</i>

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>The end doesn't exist, that's right</i>

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>owari nanka nai ze sou sa</i>

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>We're at our starting point right now</i>

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>koko wa ima bokura no shuppatsuten</i>

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.170
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.170
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>There's a tomorrow that no one knows about</i>

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>dare mo shiranai asu wa aru kara</i>

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>So keep on smiling</i>

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>waratte iyou</i>

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:10.720
<i>We're past the point of stopping
In our daily lives</i>

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:10.720
<i>imasara tachidomarenu bokura no
nichijou jou</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.220
<i>Bring on the unknown!</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.220
<i>michi joutou!</i>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.560
<i>That day, I drew on the wall with you</i>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.560
<i>ano hi kimi to kabe ni kaita</i>

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:17.190
<i>The incomplete, the imperfect</i>

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:17.190
<i>mikansei wo fukanzen wo</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>"You can't go anywhere at this point"</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>imasara doko e mo ikenai ze tte</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>Oh, is that so?! Oh, is that so?!</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>aa sou kai nee! aa sou kai nee!</i>

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>Then we don't want to become a grown-up</i>

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>nara otona ni nanka natcha ikenai nee</i>

00:22:31.030 --> 00:22:32.830
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:35.960
<i>Metalgarurumon.</i>

00:22:35.960 --> 00:22:38.710
<i>This Digimon mega evolves
from Weregarurumon.</i>

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:38.710
LEVEL: MEGA

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:41.050
TYPE: CYBORG

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:42.750
<i>This is the final form of Garurumon
that is completely metallized!</i>

00:22:41.050 --> 00:22:43.340
SPECIAL MOVE: COCYTUS BREATH

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:45.430
<i>Now, let's check myself out!</i>

00:22:45.430 --> 00:22:46.670
<i>Gabumon this time?!</i>

00:22:46.670 --> 00:22:49.720
<i>Actually, my jaw isn't metallized.</i>

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:53.310
<i>When Yamato pets this part,
it feels really good!</i>

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:55.100
<i>I want to pet it too!</i>

00:22:57.770 --> 00:23:00.060
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:07.320
<i>Will Takeru be able to save
Angemon from the darkness?</i>

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:11.160
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Sword of Hope"</i>

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:14.200
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
